onyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T08:15:10-07:00","id":1065773,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1065096-mr-pickles-and-the-wyrm?p=1065772#post1065772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'll admit I can usually only watch a couple episodes of Mr. Pickles before I have to leave the room.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that is how it was for me also. I watched one and had to go do something else, haha.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T08:51:22-07:00","id":1065803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Monalfie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1065096-mr-pickles-and-the-wyrm?p=1065755#post1065755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Why are you always the one to go right to this kind of stuff?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Because that is the nature of evil, especially in a setting like cWoD. Evil people use rape and sexual exploitation for their edification and as a tool to accomplish their goals. I think it is unrealistic to think that something as evil as one of the BSD would not use rape and sexual exploitation.<br /> <br /> I think BSD would be tickled pink to use their powers to rape hundreds of women (the women did not consent to have sex with them but, instead, with their husbands) over a decade without anyone involved understanding that they had been violated. When they 'run away' after a decade, they have sired an average of 90 children (9 Garou and 81 Kinfolk). If the community is old enough, the BSD Tribe could repeat the same tactic every decade, gradually transforming the entire community into a BSD Kinfolk community over a century or two.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T09:34:39-07:00","id":1065822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1065096-mr-pickles-and-the-wyrm?p=1065803#post1065803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because that is the nature of evil, especially in a setting like cWoD. Evil people use rape and sexual exploitation for their edification and as a tool to accomplish their goals. I think it is unrealistic to think that something as evil as one of the BSD would not use rape and sexual exploitation.<br /> <br /> I think BSD would be tickled pink to use their powers to rape hundreds of women (the women did not consent to have sex with them but, instead, with their husbands) over a decade without anyone involved understanding that they had been violated. When they 'run away' after a decade, they have sired an average of 90 children (9 Garou and 81 Kinfolk). If the community is old enough, the BSD Tribe could repeat the same tactic every decade, gradually transforming the entire community into a BSD Kinfolk community over a century or two.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just feels like every time I see you discuss the nature of evil, you have to bring up really bizarre sexual situations consistently. Not just here, but talking about Vampires, Nephandi, etc. Seems like your go-to.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12552-monalfie","name":"Monalfie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12552_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T11:29:52-07:00","id":1065872,"title":"","content":"Is there actually a way for a Garou to steal a particular Human's appearance? Is that